    {
      "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites",
      "title": "Exploring the homeland of star sprites",
      "anchor": "Exploring_the_homeland_of_star_sprites",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:111jbr2",
          "html": "<i>Teleport to Zolarea</i> with the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Portal_(Zolarea)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">portal</a>.",
          "text": "Teleport to Zolarea with the portal.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:wkn4gg",
          "html": "Unequip any items in your main/off-hand slots and <i>jump</i> the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rocky_edge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">rocky edge</a> to the east.",
          "text": "Unequip any items in your main/off-hand slots and jump the rocky edge to the east.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:16uu1f5",
          "html": "Fly to the large island to the east and <i>jump</i> to the rocky edge to land.<br>Players can <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Surge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Surge</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dive</a> during flight.",
          "text": "Fly to the large island to the east and jump to the rocky edge to land.Players can Surge and Dive during flight.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:vg479b",
          "html": "Head south-east to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Giant_crystal_(Zolarea)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">giant crystal</a> towards the centre and talk to Wizard Rosalina.",
          "text": "Head south-east to the giant crystal towards the centre and talk to Wizard Rosalina.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "~",
                  "text": "[Any option]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:tzkeqh",
          "html": "<i>Jump</i> the rocky edge on the northernmost side of the main island.",
          "text": "Jump the rocky edge on the northernmost side of the main island.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:1txkbof",
          "html": "Head to the north-easternmost island and <i>inspect</i> the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mysterious_decay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mysterious decay</a>.",
          "text": "Head to the north-easternmost island and inspect the mysterious decay.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:utg7fp",
          "html": "Return to the main island and then <i>inspect</i> the mysterious decay south of the rocky edge and west of the flower patch.",
          "text": "Return to the main island and then inspect the mysterious decay south of the rocky edge and west of the flower patch.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:d8l0or",
          "html": "Attempt to <i>enter</i> the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cave_entrance_(Zolarea)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cave entrance</a> to the west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Giant_crystal_(Zolarea)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">giant crystal</a>. (1/12)",
          "text": "Attempt to enter the cave entrance to the west of the giant crystal. (1/12)",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:1svd4gl",
          "html": "Head to the south side of the main island and <i>inspect</i> the mysterious decay (2/12), then talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rox</a>. (3/12)",
          "text": "Head to the south side of the main island and inspect the mysterious decay (2/12), then talk to Rox. (3/12)",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:1cp8rni",
          "html": "Head west to the southernmost house and <i>lift</i> the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Woven_rug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">woven rug</a>, then talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Nuub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nuub</a>. (4/12)",
          "text": "Head west to the southernmost house and lift the woven rug, then talk to Nuub. (4/12)",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:10947hf",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Blip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blip</a> near Wizard Rosalina. (5/12)",
          "text": "Talk to Blip near Wizard Rosalina. (5/12)",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "exploring-the-homeland-of-star-sprites:ad5uty",
          "html": "Talk to Wizard Rosalina.<br>If the necessary chat options display &quot;???&quot;, you missed a clue.<br>If done correctly, you receive a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wrinkly_scroll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">wrinkly scroll</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to Wizard Rosalina.If the necessary chat options display \"???\", you missed a clue.If done correctly, you receive a wrinkly scroll.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I found some information..."
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Parts of the planet are dying."
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "There is a cave in the center of the planet."
                },
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "The cave is where the elder star sprites go to die."
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "The cave is where their power source can be found."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
