      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "playing-around-dark-star:1nxadwa",
          "html": "Head to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Observatory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">observatory</a> west of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tree_Gnome_Village_(location)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tree Gnome Village</a> and north of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Castle_Wars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Castle Wars</a>.<br>The fastest teleport is <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/%27Chipped%27_Watchtower_teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&#39;Chipped&#39; Watchtower teleport</a> made by <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dave%27s_spellbook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dave&#39;s spellbook</a>.<br>See other ways of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Observatory#Getting_there\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">getting there</a>.",
          "text": "Head to the observatory west of Tree Gnome Village and north of Castle Wars.The fastest teleport is 'Chipped' Watchtower teleport made by Dave's spellbook.See other ways of getting there.",
